{"ID":"20240506114745-6o7wf4i","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506114745-6o7wf4i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506114745-6o7wf4i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619111928-bbi6dwc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607123124-0j5p50u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240625163803-bxr9ot7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:2,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:2\u0026#125;","title":"058黄耆（黄芪）","type":"doc","updated":"20240806153920"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240619111928-bbi6dwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619111928-bbi6dwc","updated":"20240619112148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产内蒙古、山西、河北等地。\n【性状】\t直根圆柱形、有的有分枝，上端较粗，长3090厘米，直径13.5厘米，表面纵皱色淡棕黄色或淡棕褐色，有不整齐的纵皱纹或纵沟质，硬而韧有粉性，皮部黄白较疏松；木部菊花纹理状，气似豆腥味微甜。老根中心偶有枯朽状，黑褐色或呈空洞。气微，味微甜，嚼之微有豆腥味。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t补气固表，利尿托毒，排脓，敛疮生肌的功效。用于气虚乏力，食少便溏，中气下陷，久泻脱肛，便血崩漏，表虚自汗，痈疽难溃，久溃不敛，血虚萎黄，内热消渴。\n【炙品】\t炒黄芪为黄芪片用麸炒至深黄色，筛出晾凉人药者。健脾和胃功效增强。\n炙黄芪又名蜜炙黄芪，蜜黄芪。为黄芪片用蜂蜜拌匀，炒至不粘手时取出摊晾，而后入药者。补气润肺功效增强。\n【注解】\t“金盏银盘”：指黄芪药材的横切面，木部呈黄色，皮部呈白色，如同金银相映。"}]},{"ID":"20240619112212-6uezw5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619112212-6uezw5f","updated":"20240619112212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085032-1b8zdd8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619112212-uzild41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619112212-uzild41","updated":"20240619112212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芪"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芪-20240205165842-aeudzib.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619112212-i94gylv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619112212-i94gylv","updated":"20240619112212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芪切片"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芪切片-20240205165842-23dvpcb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619111818-mxsw68k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619111818-mxsw68k","updated":"20240619111818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 419px;","style":"width: 409px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芪"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芪-20240619111201-m2kk60e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 409px;\" parent-style=\"width: 419px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 399px;","style":"width: 389px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芪2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芪2-20240619111347-h86a6in.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 389px;\" parent-style=\"width: 399px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806151844-hnov9mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806151844-hnov9mk","updated":"20240806152040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":